the lead early in the breaststroke, and kept opening up, winning easily in 4:14.23, with Namesnik second, 1.34 seconds behind."] "\n\n" [:p {} "A few days later, Darnyi would again win the 200 IM, completing a double-double in the individual medleys, a rare occurrence at the Olympics. It had only been done before in a single stroke or specialty in the 100/200 back by East German " [:a {:href "/athletes/47595"} "Roland Matthes"] " in 1968-72, although Ukrainian " [:a {:href "/athletes/93833"} "Yana Klochkova"] " would repeat Darnyi’s double-double in the women’s IMs in 2000-04."] "\n"] [:table {:class "table table-striped"} [:thead {} [:tr {} [:th {} "Pos"] [:th {} "Number"] [:th {} "Competitor"] [:th {} "NOC"] [:th {} "R1"] [:th {} "B Final"] [:th {} "Final"] [:th {}] [:th {}] [:th {}]]] [:tbody {} [:tr {:class "", :style ""} [:td {} "1"] [:td {:class "bib"} "329"] [:td {} [:a {:href "/athletes/48168"} "Tamás Darnyi"]] [:td {} [:a {:href "/countries/HUN"} [:img {:style "padding-right: 2px; vertical-align: middle", :src "https://olympedia-flags.s3.eu-central-1.amazonaws.com/HUN.png"}] "HUN"]] [:td {} "4:18.34 (1 h5)"] [:td {} "–"] [:td {} "4:14.23 (1)"] [:td {} [:span {:class "Gold"} "Gold"]] [:td {}] [:td {}]] [:tr {:class "", :style ""} [:td {} "2"] [:td {:class "bib"} "625"] [:td {} [:a {:href "/athletes/51504"} "Eric Namesnik"]] [:td {} [:a {:href "/countries/USA"} [:img {:style "padding-right: 2px; vertical-align: middle", :src "https://olympedia-flags.s3.eu-central-1.amazonaws.com/USA.png"}] "USA"]] [:td {} "4:17.75 (1 h4)"] [:td {} "–"] [:td {} "4:15.57 (2)"] [:td {} [:span {:class "Silver"} "Silver"]] [:td {}] [:td {}]] [:tr {:class "", :style ""} [:td {} "3"] [:td {:class "bib"} "372"] [:td {} [:a {:href "/athletes/48576"} "Luca Sacchi"]] [:td {} [:a {:href "/countries/ITA"} [:img {:style "padding-right: 2px; vertical-align: middle", :src "https://olympedia-flags.s3.eu-central-1.amazonaws.com/ITA.png"}] "ITA"]] [:td {} "4:19.42 (1 h3)"] [:td {} "–"] [:td {} 